rustfetch (0.2.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Byte-exact RUSTFETCH_PARITY_VERSION mode (fastfetch line-wrap default
    and sysfs-DRM display detection).
  * Portability: i686, armv7, riscv64, FreeBSD and NetBSD compile checks;
    standalone FreeBSD port; persistent cargo cache at /var/cache/zstd5.
  * Installer works from sh/bash/zsh on Linux and macOS, with broader
    distro hints and 5 installer contract tests.

 -- hakergeniusz <hakergeniusz@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

